## Toast Notifications (Sonner)

```typescript
import { toast } from 'sonner';

// Success
toast.success('User created successfully', {
  description: 'John Doe has been added to the system',
});

// Error
toast.error('Failed to create user', {
  description: error.message || 'An unexpected error occurred',
});

// Loading
const toastId = toast.loading('Creating user...');
// Later
toast.success('User created', { id: toastId });

// Info
toast.info('Changes saved', {
  description: 'Your preferences have been updated',
});

// Warning
toast.warning('Unsaved changes', {
  description: 'You have unsaved changes that will be lost',
});
```

## Styling Patterns

### Tailwind Class Organization

Order classes logically:

1. Layout (flex, grid, etc.)
2. Spacing (p-, m-, gap-, etc.)
3. Sizing (w-, h-, max-w-, etc.)
4. Typography (text-, font-, etc.)
5. Colors (bg-, text-, border-)
6. Effects (shadow-, opacity-, etc.)
7. Responsive modifiers (md:, lg:, etc.)

```typescript
<div className="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-lg border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm">
  {/* content */}
</div>
```

### Common Utility Classes

```typescript
// Container
className = 'container mx-auto px-4';

// Card spacing
className = 'space-y-4';

// Flex layouts
className = 'flex items-center justify-between';
className = 'flex flex-col gap-4';

// Grid layouts
className = 'grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3';

// Text
className = 'text-sm text-muted-foreground';
className = 'text-lg font-semibold';

// Hover states
className = 'hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground';

// Transitions
className = 'transition-colors';
```

### Responsive Design

```typescript
// Mobile first approach
className = 'grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3';

// Hide/show on breakpoints
className = 'hidden md:block';
className = 'block md:hidden';

// Responsive spacing
className = 'p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8';
```

## Accessibility

### Form Labels

Always associate labels with inputs:

```typescript
<Label htmlFor="email">Email</Label>
<Input id="email" type="email" {...register('email')} />
```

### Button States

Disable buttons during loading:

```typescript
<Button disabled={isLoading || isSubmitting}>
  Submit
</Button>
```

### Keyboard Navigation

Ensure all interactive elements are keyboard accessible:

```typescript
<button
  type="button"
  onClick={handleClick}
  onKeyDown={(e) => e.key === 'Enter' && handleClick()}
>
  Action
</button>
```

### ARIA Labels

Add descriptive ARIA labels for icon-only buttons:

```typescript
<Button size="icon" aria-label="Delete user">
  <Trash2 className="h-4 w-4" />
</Button>
```
